{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "19e0f16ad508ef4b96c52a9075f2b24bd9f9a626c7e404ac6223c17fdba79fc9", "ja": "（明日は、いよいよ、ひなたの劇場初公演だ！\n今日は早めに帰って、明日に備え……ん？）", "zh": "（明天就是日向在剧场的首次公演了！\n今天早点回家，为明天做好准备……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cbe1a7151130e462665857d5f40cbbaf1e43c9c175f1db21c4ec7ec5888e500c", "ja": "スタジオの灯りが、まだ点いてる……\n誰か消し忘れたのかな？", "zh": "排练教室的灯还亮着……\n有人忘记关了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "773b808870281407050e4fb4ba8bf7a3c8dbb2813810a8a142115efef1c11f68", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……\nあ、{$P$}。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……\n啊，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a9e6240c619c33de5d1d7ef0c81dbb2439f9b549e320af8e320a60ac7f6791f3", "ja": "えっ……ひなた？", "zh": "咦……日向？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "dc9fb34179c6191c67733db8699944d5ce8ab18213e2abedd4d2cd909d3119ab", "ja": "ありゃあ、まだお仕事かい？\n遅くまで、お疲れさんです。", "zh": "哎呀？还在工作吗？\n忙到这么晚，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ed55af12cb953497f84b932fcc83b93364959195e72ef28fce36244f3b0f2bb7", "ja": "遅くまでって、それはこっちの台詞だよ。\nひなたこそ、まだ練習してたのか？", "zh": "那是我该说的吧。\n日向，倒是你怎么还在练习呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "58b5c205601d2f200f120c6b614a4a98b18ac71b52b1bbe7f9d036a8e6fae94a", "ja": "熱心なのはいいことだけど、\nあまり根を詰めると、明日の本番前に疲れちゃうぞ。", "zh": "有热忱是很好，\n但要是练得太忘我，明天正式上场前就会累倒啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "5f3330af289a157280019a4be8a0a6fc0a4a5d6fd049263e285c56413427a3eb", "ja": "そうだねぇ。でも、家でじっとしてても、\nなんだか落ち着かないんだわぁ。", "zh": "说得也是呢～可是，待在家里什么都不做，\n又会觉得坐立难安呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "3de63b500d62319efb13a0b7a63470b243ba4a45c209b207de17b51284520790", "ja": "えへへ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "28a22fc5ee638e89c084e1ba775112742c82e0f73aa5940cf4b0e5539e99c1ae", "ja": "そうか……実家にいた時も、何か大事なことが\nある前は、そうやって体を動かしてたとか？", "zh": "这样啊……所以你在老家时，\n在重要活动之前也会像这样活动身体吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "18648b7cdfba7d66aaa10894eceda4f6f7b7c125a8b776a260515ddff92b3dc0", "ja": "言われてみれば、そうだったかもねぇ。", "zh": "经你这么一说，好像是呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "5c49a52be66f54ac1716491b681c61ed6f5f1ca1774fea6000542bed05632b9c", "ja": "庭に出たら、畑があったし……ちょこっと\n歩けば、じいちゃんの農園もあったからねぇ。", "zh": "因为我家院子一出去就是田了……\n再走一段路就是爷爷的农园哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "9d7100192fc941172cee2b95f3a8f3d1ec112863197e8f898e81225c673b0ad9", "ja": "落ち着かなくなったら、畑いじったり、散歩したり\n……何かしら、動いてたかもしれないべさ。", "zh": "我静不下心来的时候，就会到田里做点事、\n散散步……好像真的都会活动身体哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3756e5e816639dd17be6caff065f06c962e00d84fbfa4a287cd2438d9b58745e", "ja": "そう聞くと、なんだかひなたらしいな。", "zh": "听你这样说，确实是你的作风呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "4fb9d3254eefcb2a096677eea20f3b53371e61388194527d3fa361a428bcc3ac", "ja": "じいちゃんとばあちゃん、元気にしてるだろか。\nいつかふたりを、公演に招待したいなあ……。", "zh": "不知道爷爷奶奶过得好不好？\n希望以后可以邀请他们俩来看公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "65994e34d057a4f47292b431e5a4219bd310b2723dd26026ed9d059888876350", "ja": "あれ？　ひなた、社長から家族を\n招待してもいいって言われてなかったっけ？", "zh": "咦？日向，社长没跟你说过\n可以邀请家人来看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "2edef305d836330d1197356d8f2e362b88e25113efe76230697c26be8c7ab3c1", "ja": "あれは、断わったんだよぉ。\nあたしには、まだ早いべさ。", "zh": "是我拒绝社长的好意了～\n对我来说还太早哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "c31b94907c8f85aff5c38b67d3741a6332ccc6dd698e89b7d234dc62435914ab", "ja": "それに……今家族に会って、北海道に\n帰りたくなって……泣いてしまったら、困るべさ。", "zh": "而且……现在见到家人，我会很想回北海道……\n要是因为这样哭出来就伤脑筋哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9396f8fffbbd220a8d9d04be01c4150e10d71332a45c6ab40b4dfd1bcac9ffb9", "ja": "ひなた……。", "zh": "日向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "80b5b96d80890fb20aa0c60fc655a36e56094abab42da26e5b6c220cd72ce165", "ja": "でもね、あたしが立派なアイドルになった暁には、\nみんなを招待したいなって思ってるんだわぁ。", "zh": "不过呢，等我成为出色的偶像时，\n我就要邀请家人来看哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "aefd44c6464a1c4c3ac7b5fdd6798ec11eff4e716232bf028763932067bd6605", "ja": "それがね、今のあたしの夢なんだけども……\nできるかなあ、あたしに。", "zh": "那就是我目前的梦想……\n不知道我能不能实现～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "78ac9213c28756b2920664f8d22dc0f41de4d10802a0ea6cbbd2f8d30a26ea22", "ja": "もちろん、できるさ。\nいつか大きな会場に、ひなたの家族を招待しような！", "zh": "当然没问题啊。\n总有一天要邀请日向的家人来很大的会场看你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1eb31ea8078e4346b14496ce570cad4e8d50ec3ea067e86b28cd44cc7088baef", "ja": "そのためにも、まずは……。", "zh": "所以为了实现这个梦想，首先要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "2c904902f10d4647e33dafb1bd5230d73b49323706880c2780a693f552d5f98b", "ja": "うん！\n{$P$}、ありがとねえ。", "zh": "我知道！\n{$P$}，谢谢你哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "d6401e23a67451701a55cdeb9e0b79d92d892323da1a77135e6c91c0c24fb4c6", "ja": "あたし、みんなを招待できるように……\n明日の公演、頑張るよぉ！", "zh": "明天的公演我会努力演出……\n这样以后才有机会邀请家人来看我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_035hin_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_003_1025_p", "source_sha256": "e274ad9a98ba6d10038b59519524da627362dceee2130020fe4e9b3c00aac1fe", "ja": "（まずはひなたの言う通り、明日の初公演だ！\n全力で、この小さな背中を支えるぞ……！）", "zh": "（就像日向说的，先从明天的首次公演开始！\n我也要在她娇小的身后全力支持……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
